Saphira firmware toolkit group
==============================

Installing this package installs the normal safe Saphira
firmware-management toolkit: SPI flash programming (flashrom),
coreboot/UEFI image inspection (coreboot-tools, uefi-tools),
Intel ME image inspection (me-analyzer) and modification
(me-cleaner, file-level only), local MEI/AMT status (mei-amt-check,
metee), and the low-level I2C/MSR/PCI/USB/DMI/EFI utilities plus
their libraries.

This package carries no payload of its own beyond this file. The
authoritative member list is the `depends` field of this package's
APK metadata (`apk info -a firmware-tools`).

Deliberately excluded: chipsec (research-only low-level access, a
separate package by policy), intel-lms (blocked on the unpackaged ACE
framework - see project record), fwupd (blocked on unpackaged
libxmlb/polkit/fwupd-efi), and all proprietary Intel FIT/FITC/FPT
System Tools (no redistribution rights).

Flash/descriptor/ME write operations are never run by package tests;
they are deliberate operator actions on real hardware.
